{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：17:23 2026-11-13 HKT<br/>發佈時間：17:23 2026-11-13 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：17:23 2026-11-13 HKT</p><img alt=\"石硤尾小巴撞倒過路翁 76歲男司機涉危駕被捕\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/301e7c9eae5c94b7f6ff3169961b6dfd/2026-11/ha_ming.jpg\"/><p>石硤尾窩仔街近偉智街，一部小巴今日（11月13日）早上10時許駛出小巴站時，意外撞倒一名途人。救護員接報趕至，發現被撞的76歲姓黃老翁右腳受傷，但仍有意識，隨即將他送送往明愛醫院就職。</p><p>警方經調查後，以涉嫌危險駕駛引致他人身體受嚴重傷害，將76歲姓林男司機拘捕扣查。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T09:39:16.865011+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T09:23:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T13:35:46.669074+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T09:32:37.568316+00:00","content_hash":"088791c5627f764edfb7e775d96854203ee5c134ffe8a8cf4f609ea59b4938d6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}